  "description": "Engaged PQ-4 audio signal path from the Boss-labelled schematic. High and Middle use linked pairs of 50 kΩ rheostats. Boost/cut controls use linear three-terminal proxies for the original four-terminal W-taper knobs. Bypass switching is omitted and 2N3904 substitutes for 2SC3378-GR.",
  "groundNode": "0",
  "inputNode": "in",
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Level",
      "Low",
      "Middle Frequency",
      "Middle Gain",
      "High Frequency",
      "High Gain",
      "Presence"
    ]
  },
